 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Four ways of wishing",
     "texto": [
      "**Mong** = to look forward eagerly to something that **may** happen: «Tôi **mong** sớm gặp lại bạn» = I look forward to seeing you again soon. Very common at the end of letters.",
      "**Hy vọng** = to hope that something turns out well: «Tôi **hy vọng** sẽ thi đỗ» = I hope to pass the exam. Almost the same as «mong», but it speaks more of confidence than of desire.",
      "**Ước** expresses a wish or a situation one would like to be real; it often has a hypothetical or still unfulfilled sense, but it doesn't have to be impossible: «Tôi ước được bay như chim» = I dream of flying like a bird. You already know «ước gì». **Chúc + person** is the usual formula to wish someone something good: «Chúc bạn thành công!» = I wish you success!",
      "Tip: **mong** and **hy vọng** usually refer to something that can still happen; **ước** presents a wish, often hypothetical; **chúc** is usually used to direct a good wish at another person.",
      "Tip: **mong** and **hy vọng** look at what's possible; **ước**, at what doesn't depend on you; **chúc** is a gift you give with words."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about a dream",
     "texto": [
      "**Ước mơ của tôi là…** = my dream is… **Từ nhỏ tôi đã mơ ước…** = since I was little I've dreamed of… **thực hiện ước mơ** = to make a dream come true. **theo đuổi** = to pursue (a dream). **từ bỏ** = to give up."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
